 Association StudentCohortAssociation
    documentation "This association represents the cohort(s) for which a student is designated."
    domain entity Student
        documentation "The student associated with the cohort."
    domain entity Cohort
        documentation "Reference to the cohort associated with the student."
    date BeginDate
        documentation "The month, day, and year on which the student was first identified as part of the cohort.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is part of identity
    date EndDate
        documentation "The month, day, and year on which the student was removed as part of the cohort.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    domain entity Section
        documentation "The cohort representing the subdivision of students within one or more sections. For example, a group of students may be given additional instruction and tracked as a cohort."
        is optional collection